# HOMESPUN: the loot tables, rolled 10,000 times each (expected values in
# brackets). Foes: low 99 % 3 glints, 1 % a bar [29,700 glints, 100 bars];
# normal 70 % 5 glints, 10 % 1-2 bars, 10 % an odd, 10 % jerky [35,000,
# 1,500, 1,000, 1,000]; high 50 % 20 glints, 25 % 1-3 bars, 12.5 % 1-3
# odds, 12.5 % jerky [100,000, 5,000, 2,500, 1,250]; no foe drops a tonic.
# A boss's extra roll: 81.25 % a glint, 6.25 % each a bar, an odd, jerky.
# Pots (one roll) and chests (ten): in the open 22/32 1-5 glints, 4/32 a
# bar, 3/32 an odd, 2/32 a driplet, 1/32 jerky; in dungeons 16/26, 4/26,
# 3/26, 2/26, 1/26.
seed 44
game homespun
wait 5
cheat newgame 124
wait 5
expect loot0_0 >= 29500
expect loot0_0 <= 29900
expect loot0_1 >= 60
expect loot0_1 <= 140
expect loot0_2 == 0
expect loot1_0 >= 34200
expect loot1_0 <= 35800
expect loot1_1 >= 1350
expect loot1_1 <= 1650
expect loot1_2 >= 900
expect loot1_2 <= 1100
expect loot1_3 >= 900
expect loot1_3 <= 1100
expect loot2_0 >= 98000
expect loot2_0 <= 102000
expect loot2_1 >= 4700
expect loot2_1 <= 5300
expect loot2_2 >= 2300
expect loot2_2 <= 2700
expect loot2_3 >= 1150
expect loot2_3 <= 1350
expect loot3_0 >= 8000
expect loot3_0 <= 8250
expect loot3_3 >= 550
expect loot3_3 <= 700
# the open: 20,625 glints, 1,250 bars, 938 odds, 313 jerky, 625 driplets
expect env0_0 >= 20000
expect env0_0 <= 21300
expect env0_1 >= 1150
expect env0_1 <= 1350
expect env0_2 >= 850
expect env0_2 <= 1030
expect env0_3 >= 260
expect env0_3 <= 370
expect env0_4 >= 550
expect env0_4 <= 700
# dungeons: 18,462 glints, 1,538 bars, 1,154 odds, 385 jerky, 769 driplets
expect env1_0 >= 17800
expect env1_0 <= 19100
expect env1_1 >= 1420
expect env1_1 <= 1660
expect env1_4 >= 680
expect env1_4 <= 860
# a chest in the open, opened: ten rolls come out, maybe a driplet with them
cheat trip 5
cheat clearmobs
cheat gokind 3 120 104
cheat face 0 -1
press A
expect items >= 1
